  "extensions": {
    "story": "## Purpose\n\nCatalog of Hawiety institutes (legacy OrganizationId). Drives dedicated member lists, invite policy, and optional phone masking policy.\n\n## Scenarios\n\n- **S5** — `allows_self_registration`, `allows_invite`, `invite_expires_after_days`, `hide_member_phones`.\n- **S6** — `has_dedicated_list` pairs with `hwy_member_list_defs` (institute logic).\n\n## Rules\n\n- PK is legacy id (not identity).\n- General Assembly employment fields live on `hwy_member_institutes`, not here.",
